---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: tuesday.predictions
  size: 1
  alias: p
permalink: "/tuesday/p/{{ p.id | lower }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "The machine predicts: {{ p.prediction }}"
  description: "A dated prediction from WE's Your Tuesday in 2030. Due {{ p.deadline | readable }}. It stays up whether it comes true or not."
---
<p class="tq-eyebrow"><a href="{{ '/tuesday/' | url }}">Your Tuesday in 2030</a> · prediction {{ p.id }}</p>

<h1 class="tq-pred">🤖 The machine predicts: {{ p.prediction | replace("By ", "by ") }}</h1>

<p class="tq-status">Status: <strong>{% if p.status == "open" %}open, not yet due{% else %}{{ p.status }}{% endif %}</strong> · due {{ p.deadline | readable }}</p>

<p><strong>Why the machine thinks so.</strong> {{ p.why }}</p>
<p><strong>How it will be checked.</strong> {{ p.check }}</p>
<p>If it comes true, this page says so. If it doesn't, this page says that instead, and stays up.</p>

<p><a class="tq-cta" href="{{ '/tuesday/' | url }}">Get your own Tuesday in 2030 →</a></p>

<style>
.tq-eyebrow { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--quiet); }
.tq-eyebrow a { color: inherit; }
.tq-pred { font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.25; text-wrap: balance; }
.tq-status { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .8125rem; }
.tq-cta { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .875rem; }
</style>
